### main.py — Routes
```
GET  /api/health              → HealthResponse | 503 if DB probe fails
GET  /api/search?query=str    → list[FoodSearchResult]  ([] if <2 chars; 400 if >100)
                                Rate: 60/min
GET  /api/food/{fdc_id:int}   → FoodDetail              (404 if absent)
                                Rate: 120/min;  Path validator ge=1
POST /api/generate_label      → Response(PDF bytes, application/pdf)
  Body: GenerateLabelRequest   Rate: 10/min  Timeout: 10s  Semaphore(2)
  Headers: Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="nutrition_label.pdf"
           Cache-Control: no-store
  Errors: 400 (validation/missing IDs) | 429 (rate + Retry-After) | 504 (timeout) | 500
Middleware order: BodySizeLimit (64 KB) → TrustedHost → CORS (dev only)
Logging: one-line JSON to stdout; LOG_LEVEL env (default INFO)
Handlers: RateLimitExceeded → 429 JSON+Retry-After; Exception → 500 JSON
```

